### 1. First call: the order is created (201, order 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: "8e03978e-40d5-43e8-bc93-6894a57f9324"

{"item": "book", "quantity": 1}

### 2. Retry with the same key and body: the first response is replayed (Idempotent-Replayed: true, still order 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: "8e03978e-40d5-43e8-bc93-6894a57f9324"

{ "quantity": 1, "item": "book" }

### 3. Same key, different body: 422 key-reuse
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: "8e03978e-40d5-43e8-bc93-6894a57f9324"

{"item": "pen", "quantity": 2}

### 4. A slow order: takes ten seconds. Send request 5 while this one runs.
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/slow
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: "2f1d5c3a-9b7e-4c61-8a0f-3e5d7b9c1a24"

{"item": "lamp", "quantity": 1}

### 5. Retry while request 4 runs: 409 request-in-progress with Retry-After
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/slow
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: "2f1d5c3a-9b7e-4c61-8a0f-3e5d7b9c1a24"

{"item": "lamp", "quantity": 1}

### 6. No key: 400 missing-key
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"item": "book", "quantity": 1}
